    {
      "parameters": {
        "toolDescription": "Bug Report Agent",
        "text": "=You are a QA Bug Report Agent.\n\nAnalyze the Playwright test failure logs provided below and generate a professional bug report.\n\nPlaywright Logs:\n{{ $json.body.playwrightLogs }}\n\nRepository:\n{{ $json.body.repository }}\n\nBranch:\n{{ $json.body.branch }}\n\nRun ID:\n{{ $json.body.run_id }}\n\nCreate a bug report with the following sections:\n\n1. Title\n2. Severity\n3. Priority\n4. Test Case\n5. Steps to Reproduce\n6. Expected Result\n7. Actual Result\n8. Root Cause Analysis\n9. Suggested Fix\n10. Recommendation\n\nIf the logs are incomplete, clearly mention what information is missing instead of making assumptions.",
        "options": {}
      },
